13. _igi_ li-bu-ra-am sza _ka2_ ga-gi-im 
#tr.ts: maḫar libu(r)ram ša bāb gagîm
#tr.en: before Liburram, (official) of the cloister’s gate;

14. _igi_ i-ba-lu-ut, _dumu_ {d}iszkur-re-me-ni 
#tr.ts: maḫar ibaluṭ mār adad-rēmēni
#tr.en: before Ibaluṭ son of Adad-rēmēni;

15. _igi_ i-da-du-um _i3-du8_ 
#tr.ts: maḫar idadum atîm
#tr.en: before Idadum, the doorkeeper;

16. _igi_ {d}utu-tab-ba-e sza _ka2_ ga-gi-im 
#tr.ts: maḫar šamaš-tappê ša bāb gagîm
#tr.en: before Šamaš-tappê, (official) of the cloister’s gate;

17. _igi#_ a-ra-rum _dumu_ be-la-nim 
#tr.ts: maḫar ararum mār bēlanum
#tr.en: before Ararum son of Bēlanum;

18. _igi_ sin-ia-tum _maszkim di-ku5-mesz_ 
#tr.ts: maḫar sîyyatum rābiṣ dayyānī
#tr.en: before Sîyyatum, inspector of the judges.
